#. type: Title #
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "016 — Security workflow"
msgstr "016 — Fluxo de segurança"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
msgid "Security issues are typically sent via [a security form](https://www.yiiframework.com/security)."
msgstr "Problemas de segurança normalmente são enviados pelo [formulário de segurança](https://www.yiiframework.com/security)."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If an issue is reported directly to a public page such as a repository issue or a forum topic, get the message\n"
"and delete the issue. Say thanks to the reporter and point to the security form for next time.  \n"
msgstr ""
"Se um problema for relatado diretamente em uma página pública, como uma issue do repositório ou um tópico do fórum, copie a mensagem\n"
"e apague a issue. Agradeça a quem relatou e indique o formulário de segurança para a próxima vez.  \n"

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart TD\n"
"    form[Security form report] --> verify[Verify issue]\n"
"    public[Public report] --> remove[Save details and delete public issue]\n"
"    remove --> redirect[Point reporter to the security form]\n"
"    redirect --> verify\n"
"    verify -->|needs details| requestInfo[Request more information]\n"
"    requestInfo --> verify\n"
"    verify -->|valid| advisory[Create draft security advisory]\n"
"    advisory --> severity[Set CVSS severity]\n"
"    severity --> credit[Ask about reporter credit]\n"
"    credit --> cve[Request CVE number]\n"
"    cve --> patch[Prepare patch pull request]\n"
"    patch --> wait[Wait for CVE allocation]\n"
"    wait --> release[Release]\n"
"    release --> publish[Publish advisory and submit FriendsOfPHP entry]\n"
msgstr ""
"flowchart TD\n"
"    form[Relato pelo formulário de segurança] --> verify[Verificar o problema]\n"
"    public[Relato público] --> remove[Salvar os detalhes e apagar a issue pública]\n"
"    remove --> redirect[Indicar o formulário de segurança a quem relatou]\n"
"    redirect --> verify\n"
"    verify -->|precisa de detalhes| requestInfo[Pedir mais informações]\n"
"    requestInfo --> verify\n"
"    verify -->|válido| advisory[Criar rascunho de security advisory]\n"
"    advisory --> severity[Definir a severidade CVSS]\n"
"    severity --> credit[Perguntar sobre o crédito a quem relatou]\n"
"    credit --> cve[Solicitar número CVE]\n"
"    cve --> patch[Preparar pull request com o patch]\n"
"    patch --> wait[Aguardar a atribuição do CVE]\n"
"    wait --> release[Release]\n"
"    release --> publish[Publicar o advisory e enviar entrada ao FriendsOfPHP]\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Verificar"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
msgid "Verify that the issue is valid. Request more information if needed."
msgstr "Verifique se o problema é válido. Peça mais informações, se necessário."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add security advisory"
msgstr "Adicionar security advisory"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
msgid "Create a draft GitHub security advisory."
msgstr "Crie um rascunho de security advisory no GitHub."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find out severity"
msgstr "Descobrir a severidade"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
msgid "Get CVSS score using [NVD calculator](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln-metrics/cvss/v3-calculator)."
msgstr "Obtenha a pontuação CVSS usando a [calculadora do NVD](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln-metrics/cvss/v3-calculator)."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
msgid "Choose severity based on the [rating scale](https://www.first.org/cvss/specification-document#Qualitative-Severity-Rating-Scale)."
msgstr "Escolha a severidade com base na [escala de classificação](https://www.first.org/cvss/specification-document#Qualitative-Severity-Rating-Scale)."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Give credit to the reporter"
msgstr "Dar crédito a quem relatou"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
msgid "Ask the reporter if he wants a credit for finding the issue. If so, point to his GitHub account."
msgstr "Pergunte a quem relatou se deseja receber crédito por ter encontrado o problema. Se sim, indique a conta dessa pessoa no GitHub."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Request a CVE number"
msgstr "Solicitar um número CVE"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
msgid "When you're ready, request a CVE."
msgstr "Quando estiver pronto, solicite um CVE."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare a patch"
msgstr "Preparar um patch"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
msgid "Prepare a pull request fixing the issue. GitHub allows doing it in a private fork."
msgstr "Prepare um pull request que corrija o problema. O GitHub permite fazer isso em um fork privado."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Wait till the CVE number is allocated "
msgstr "Aguardar a atribuição do número CVE "

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
msgid "It usually takes several days."
msgstr "Normalmente leva alguns dias."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Release"
msgstr "Release"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
msgid "Merge the patch pull request right before tagging the next package release."
msgstr "Faça o merge do pull request com o patch logo antes de criar a tag do próximo release do pacote."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
msgid "Publish security advisory."
msgstr "Publique o security advisory."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/016-security-workflow.md
msgid "Add CVE to [FriendsOfPHP/security-advisories](https://github.com/FriendsOfPHP/security-advisories).  See [#488](https://github.com/FriendsOfPHP/security-advisories/pull/488) as an example."
msgstr "Adicione o CVE em [FriendsOfPHP/security-advisories](https://github.com/FriendsOfPHP/security-advisories).  Veja [#488](https://github.com/FriendsOfPHP/security-advisories/pull/488) como exemplo."
